---
title: Sequence Diagram — Multi-Tool Init Flow (common_params_parse)
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (argv)
    participant Tool as Tool main()
    participant Parser as common_params_parse<br><code>arg.cpp:1013</code>
    participant ParserInit as common_params_parser_init<br><code>arg.cpp:1126</code>
    participant Download as common_models_handler<br><code>arg.cpp:353-536</code>
    participant Engine as llama.h / LLM

    User ->> Tool: argv, argc
    Tool ->> Parser: common_params_parse()
    Parser ->> ParserInit: common_params_parser_init(params, ex)
    ParserInit ->> ParserInit: build add_opt chain<br>~200 option definitions
    ParserInit -->> Parser: ctx_arg (options + params)
    Parser ->> Parser: common_params_parse_ex()

    alt Environment variables
        Parser ->> Parser: for each option: get_value_from_env()
    end

    Parser ->> Parser: parse_cli_args()<br>arg.cpp:590-651

    Parser ->> Download: common_models_handler_init()
    Download ->> Download: build HF download plan<br>arg.cpp:376-381
    Download -->> Parser: handler

    Parser ->> Download: common_models_handler_apply()
    alt Has HF repo
        Download ->> Download: download from HuggingFace<br>arg.cpp:487-499
    end
    alt Has URL
        Download ->> Download: build_url_tasks()<br>arg.cpp:387-423
    end
    alt Has RPC servers
        Download ->> Download: add_rpc_devices()<br>arg.cpp:899-918
    end
    Download -->> Parser: params.model.path set

    alt --help / --usage
        Parser ->> Parser: common_params_print_usage()<br>arg.cpp:727-763
        Parser -->> Tool: exit(0)
    end

    Parser -->> Tool: return true

    Tool ->> Engine: model load + decode
    note over Tool, Engine: tool-specific work
